---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import bowl from '../assets/tasting-bowl.jpg';
---

<section class="intro">
  <Image src={bowl} alt="A small clay copita, the traditional cup for sipping mezcal" class="photo" widths={[600]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw" />
  <div class="text">
    <p>
      Journey through Mexico’s rich and dynamic world of spirits - tequila, mezcal, bacanora, raicilla, sotol, destilado
      de agave, along with Mexican rum, whiskey, gin, and amaros. Each bottle tells a story of craft, culture, and terroir
      - a reflection of the land and the hands that shape it. Learn how to “kiss the spirit” - a mindful approach to
      tasting that awakens the senses and reveals the layers of aroma, texture, and complexity within every sip.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    min-height: 330px;
    background: var(--charcoal);
  }
  .photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .text {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 40px clamp(16px, 6vw, 58px);
    color: var(--sand);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .text p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 38ch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .photo {
      aspect-ratio: 5 / 4;
    }
  }
</style>
